                                                "sense_id": "532a69ff-818c-3a0c-ac5f-f11fa38c0d69",
                                                "text": "Grieving apparently wasn't a full-time job, however, since Hank up and married a gal named Billie Jean and daddied a daughter by yet another consoler."
